  "description": "The meme uses a grotesque, non-human visual metaphor (a goblin-like creature) to imply that Erdoğan is not human or is monstrous. This rhetorical device is a form of hate speech that reduces a political figure to a caricature, relying on real-world knowledge of how such metaphors are used to incite prejudice and contempt.",
